abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package of the paper "Brachistochrones inside static stars: existence, global minimality and exact
  results for two uniform-density interiors". Wolfram Language scripts provide symbolic and numerical checks for the
  results listed in RESULTS_MAP.md (analytic proof steps are not executed); a single Python entry point runs them in profiles quick, full and release and validates the
  JSON results against a reviewed manifest. The DOI above is the concept DOI of all versions.
